[{"id":176553531,"discussion_id":"ea7cfda0593b25c8d6951f6f05ddc4dd544d60c5","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*蒋礼锐*](https://gitcode.com/jiang-lirui), [*zzy__*](https://gitcode.com/zzy__) (2/2) | ✅ [*蒋礼锐*](https://gitcode.com/jiang-lirui) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n wlfsnw, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-06-22T17:10:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-23T11:04:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176560106,"discussion_id":"e89b524a27c2ef9dbfb56c3f4843c24970ec7859","body":"Based on my thorough review of both changed files, here is the summary:\n\n#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 主要修复 FlashDecode 路径中的一个 bug，核心改动是为 `FANoQuantBlockVecInfer` 的 `FlashDecodeCompute` 函数新增 Q 序列（query）实际长度的感知能力。新增了 `GetActualSeqLenQ` 函数用于计算当前 batch 的 query 实际长度，并在 TND/NTD layout 下根据累积 query 长度前缀和重新计算输出偏移 `attenOutOffset`，同时将早退条件从仅判断 KV 长度为零扩展为同时判断 Q 长度与 KV 长度。调用方 `FlashAttentionNoQuantKernelInfer::Process()` 中同步传递了新增的 `actualSeqQlenAddr` 参数。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **新增 `GetActualSeqLenQ` 函数**：在 `flash_attention_noquant_block_vec_infer.h` 中新增该函数（第 533–554 行），根据 `isActualLenDimsNull`、`actualSeqLenSize` 和 layout 类型计算当前 batch 的 query 实际长度，并处理左 padding 场景。\n- **`FlashDecodeCompute` 增加 Q 长度感知**：函数签名新增 `actualSeqQlenAddr` 参数（第 93–94、399–400 行）；内部调用 `GetActualSeqLenQ` 获取 Q 长度，早退条件扩展为 `actualSeqLenQ == 0 || actualSeqLenKv == 0`；TND/NTD layout 下使用累积 query 长度重新计算 `attenOutOffset`；`actualCombineLoopSize` 改用 `actualSeqLenKv` 计算。\n- **kernel 层调用适配**：在 `flash_attention_noquant_kernel_infer.h` 的 `Process()` 中（第 478–479 行），调用 `FlashDecodeCompute` 时新增传入 `this->actualSeqQlenAddr`。\n\n**审查结论**\n\n- `attention/common/op_kernel/arch35/flash_attention_noquant_block_vec_infer.h`：已审查，未发现代码缺陷。`GetActualSeqLenQ` 中对 `actualSeqQlenAddr` 的空指针防护（通过 `isActualLenDimsNull`）与 TND/NTD 下的指针初始化逻辑一致；数组访问模式与同仓库中 anti-quant 等已有实现一致。\n- `attention/common/op_kernel/arch35/flash_attention_noquant_kernel_infer.h`：已审查，未发现代码缺陷。仅将新增的 `actualSeqQlenAddr` 成员传递至底层函数，调用路径与基类初始化逻辑匹配。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-22T17:34:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T17:34:24+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176560621,"discussion_id":"46a0e19d3405ec8dae6efdf9f4843578bd4fc64f","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n本次 diff 修改了 2 个文件，为 FlashDecode 路径新增 Q 序列长度感知能力，主要变更包括：\n\n- 新增 `GetActualSeqLenQ` 函数用于计算 Q 方向实际序列长度\n- `FlashDecodeCompute` 新增 `actualSeqQlenAddr` 参数，支持 Q 长度感知的 zero-check 和 TND/NTD 布局下基于累积 Q 长度的输出偏移计算\n- 调用方 `flash_attention_noquant_kernel_infer.h` 同步传参更新\n\n**发现 4 个问题：**\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| P2 | 2 | `GetActualSeqLenQ` 和 `attenOutOffset` 的 TND/NTD 守卫缺少 `&& (!isPa)`，与 `GetActualSeqLenKV` 不一致，PageAttention 场景下可能导致序列长度/输出偏移计算错误 |\n| P3 | 2 | 继承自 `GetActualSeqLenKV` 的 left-padding 静默跳过模式；`s1InCurrentBatch` 可选简化 |\n\n**各文件审查结果：**\n- `attention/common/op_kernel/arch35/flash_attention_noquant_block_vec_infer.h`：4 个问题（2×P2, 2×P3）\n- `attention/common/op_kernel/arch35/flash_attention_noquant_kernel_infer.h`：无问题\n\n**整体风险判断：** 中等。两个 P2 问题涉及 PageAttention 与 TND/NTD 布局组合场景下的正确性——该组合在实践中可能不常见，但一旦触发会导致计算结果错误（序列长度误判为 0 导致计算被跳过，或输出写入错误内存位置）。建议在合入前修复 `&& (!isPa)` 守卫的缺失。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 0 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 4 |\n\n\uD83D\uDCAC 仅评论\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-22T17:36:27+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T17:36:27+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176560625,"discussion_id":"64018ef1e187a860aec7bbb09dcc223d86abb45d","body":"\uD83D\uDD35 **Low Priority**\n\n在 `GetActualSeqLenQ` 函数中，局部变量 `s1InCurrentBatch`（第 537 行）仅在 `isActualLenDimsNull` 分支中使用，在 `else` 分支中未被引用。而 `GetActualSeqLenKV` 中对应的 `s2InCurrentBatch` 可通过 `isKvContinuous == 0` 分支被覆盖为 list tensor 的实际 shape —— 但 `GetActualSeqLenQ` 没有对应的覆盖逻辑。因此 `s1InCurrentBatch` 始终等于 `constInfo.s1Size`，该变量声明可简化为直接使用 `constInfo.s1Size`，减少一层间接引用。此为可选清理，不影响正确性。\n\n**建议**：可选：将第 537 行的 `s1InCurrentBatch` 变量声明移到 `if (constInfo.isActualLenDimsNull)` 分支内部，或直接删除该变量并在第 539 行使用 `constInfo.s1Size`，以减少不必要的变量。","created_at":"2026-06-22T17:36:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T21:53:00+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"677892965b3bcb5fc8434ca7","login":"wlfsnw","object_id":"677892965b3bcb5fc8434ca7","name":"wlfsnw","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/ca/f54c22cad3f8c427edf69d6a544cab80c6d91f8f0b26be35185181b279d0d8f8.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wlfsnw"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":539,"end_new_line":539,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":176560626,"discussion_id":"df2bcdf8ed83480f29b7de7bc69013331721215e","body":"\uD83D\uDFE1 **Medium Priority**\n\n在新增的 `GetActualSeqLenQ` 函数中（第 542 行），TND/NTD 布局下对 `actualSeqQlenAddr[boIdx]` 做累积前缀差值的守卫条件是：\n而现有的 `GetActualSeqLenKV` 函数（第 577 行）中对应的守卫条件是：\n`isPa` 是 PageAttention 模板参数。在 PageAttention 场景下，`actualSeqQlenAddr` 数组存储的是每个 batch 的独立序列长度（而非累积前缀和），因此不应做减法。`GetActualSeqLenQ` 缺少 `&& (!isPa)` 会导致 PageAttention + TND/NTD 布局下 Q 实际序列长度被错误地计算为 0（或接近 0），进而触发 `FlashDecodeCompute` 中的 early return，漏掉有效计算。\n\n**建议**：将第 542 行的 `if constexpr` 条件补上 `&& (!isPa)`，与 `GetActualSeqLenKV` 保持一致。\n\n```suggestion\n        if constexpr ((layout == LayOutTypeEnum::LAYOUT_TND || layout == LayOutTypeEnum::LAYOUT_NTD) && (!isPa)) {\n```\n","created_at":"2026-06-22T17:36:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T21:53:08+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"677892965b3bcb5fc8434ca7","login":"wlfsnw","object_id":"677892965b3bcb5fc8434ca7","name":"wlfsnw","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/ca/f54c22cad3f8c427edf69d6a544cab80c6d91f8f0b26be35185181b279d0d8f8.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wlfsnw"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":542,"end_new_line":542,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":176560627,"discussion_id":"d26776133d0a4f51fc99bc3f569889e10a3a88c9","body":"\uD83D\uDFE1 **Medium Priority**\n\n在 `FlashDecodeCompute` 新增的 TND/NTD 布局 `attenOutOffset` 计算逻辑中（第 415-418 行），直接使用 `actualSeqQlenAddr[bIdx - 1]` 作为累积偏移量：\n但同文件中 `GetActualSeqLenKV`（第 577 行）的 TND/NTD 减法守卫带有 `&& (!isPa)`，表明 PageAttention 模式下 `actualSeqQlenAddr` 数组是每 batch 独立长度、非累积前缀和。如果 `isPa == true` 且 layout 为 TND/NTD，此处的 `actualSeqQlenAddr[bIdx - 1]` 作为累积偏移使用会产生错误的输出地址，导致 `CombineSplitKVRes` 写入错误的内存位置。\n\n**建议**：在第 415 行的 `if constexpr` 条件中也加上 `&& (!isPa)`，使 `attenOutOffset` 的累积偏移计算与 `GetActualSeqLenKV` 的语义保持一致。PageAttention 模式下应回退到默认的 `bIdx * n2GDv` 偏移。\n\n```suggestion\n    if constexpr ((layout == LayOutTypeEnum::LAYOUT_TND || layout == LayOutTypeEnum::LAYOUT_NTD) && (!isPa)) {\n```\n","created_at":"2026-06-22T17:36:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T21:52:40+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"677892965b3bcb5fc8434ca7","login":"wlfsnw","object_id":"677892965b3bcb5fc8434ca7","name":"wlfsnw","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/ca/f54c22cad3f8c427edf69d6a544cab80c6d91f8f0b26be35185181b279d0d8f8.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wlfsnw"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":415,"end_new_line":415,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":176605234,"body":"pa场景仅与kv相关，与query out无关","created_at":"2026-06-22T21:52:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T21:52:40+08:00","user":{"id":"677892965b3bcb5fc8434ca7","login":"wlfsnw","object_id":"677892965b3bcb5fc8434ca7","name":"wlfsnw","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/ca/f54c22cad3f8c427edf69d6a544cab80c6d91f8f0b26be35185181b279d0d8f8.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wlfsnw"}}]},{"id":176560628,"discussion_id":"20f55efb7a1ee47049be511d3325172a3a5b7ae2","body":"\uD83D\uDD35 **Low Priority**\n\n在 `GetActualSeqLenQ` 函数中（第 549 行），当 `isQHasLeftPadding` 为 true 时：\nint64_t qLeftPaddingSize = constInfo.s1Size - actualSeqLenQ - constInfo.queryRightPaddingSize;\nif (qLeftPaddingSize < 0) {\n    actualSeqLenQ = 0;\n}\n这里 `actualSeqLenQ` 是 TND/NTD 布局下经减法得到的每 batch 实际序列长度，`s1Size` 是整个 batch 的 S1 维度大小。当 `qLeftPaddingSize < 0`（即 `actualSeqLenQ + queryRightPaddingSize > s1Size`，padding 参数不合理）时，函数直接置 `actualSeqLenQ = 0`。该处理与 `GetActualSeqLenKV` 的逻辑一致，本身不是新引入的问题。但当此值被置 0 后，`FlashDecodeCompute`（第 411 行）的 early return 会使当前 batch 的 FlashDecode 合并完全跳过，而在 TND/NTD 布局下这可能导致输出 tensor 中该 batch 位置留下未初始化的残留数据。这是对已有错误处理模式的继承，但本次 diff 新增了 Q 方向上的相同模式，使该风险扩展到 Q 维度。如果 padding 参数由用户传入且可能不合理，建议考虑记录诊断日志或输出置零而非静默跳过。\n\n**建议**：如果业务上 padding 参数不会出现不一致（由上层保证），则当前逻辑可以接受。否则建议在 `qLeftPaddingSize < 0` 时除了置 `actualSeqLenQ = 0`，还应确保输出对应区域被置零而非保留未初始化数据；同时考虑添加断言或诊断日志以便排查上游传参错误。此为与 `GetActualSeqLenKV` 一致的既有模式，属于可选改进。","created_at":"2026-06-22T17:36:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T21:54:20+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"677892965b3bcb5fc8434ca7","login":"wlfsnw","object_id":"677892965b3bcb5fc8434ca7","name":"wlfsnw","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/ca/f54c22cad3f8c427edf69d6a544cab80c6d91f8f0b26be35185181b279d0d8f8.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wlfsnw"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":552,"end_new_line":552,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":176604961,"discussion_id":"f280e9ddd175997b592e2e59304fc7c29471b0c3","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-06-22T21:50:48+08:00","updated_